{"id":"5b263fc62b64e4bb","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-elementary-system.md","title":"Elementary System","display":"df-elementary-system — Elementary System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-elementary-system","aliases":["90-df-elementary-system"],"display":"df-elementary-system — Elementary System","depends_on":["[[90-df-elementary-system-definition]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-elementary-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-elementary-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-system — Elementary System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb8e9519813ba70b\" href=\"?note=eb8e9519813ba70b\" title=\"90-df-elementary-system-definition\">90-df-elementary-system-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)\">\\(\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb8e9519813ba70b\" href=\"?note=eb8e9519813ba70b\" title=\"90-df-elementary-system-definition\">90-df-elementary-system-definition</a>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a_i:i&lt;\\ell\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a_i:i&lt;\\ell\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 分别无重复，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j&lt;m\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j&lt;m\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 使用同一词模式语法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>，数值编码中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdots\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdots\\rangle\\)</span> 也采用该编码；显式编码函数的实参、模式串和原子列使用集合论有限列。下面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 是原始字串拼接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_5\">\\(\\operatorname{code}_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_5\\)</span> 分别编码具体词、词模式、具体原子、原子模式、规则和具体原子列。保留单参数短名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}\">\\(\\operatorname{code}\\)</span>，但每个实例的角色参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\{0,\\ldots,5\\}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\{0,\\ldots,5\\}\\)</span> 必须固定；混用角色的公式显式写下标。具体词也是不含变量的模式，但两种角色的数值编码不合并。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\theta:\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是具体词替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span>、有序变量索引表、替换和替换表码均在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleInst}\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleInst}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}\">\\(\\mathrm{Step}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{aind}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a_i,i):i&lt;\\ell\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Token}(a_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle\\quad(i&lt;\\ell),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Token}(v_i)\\coloneqq\\langle1,i\\rangle\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{At}^{0}_{\\mathcal E}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{P_j(\\vec w):j&lt;m\\land\\vec w\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{r_j}\\},\\\\\nE_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^*,\\quad E_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\quad\nE_2\\coloneqq\\mathrm{At}^{0}_{\\mathcal E},\\quad E_3\\coloneqq\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P},\\\\\nE_4&amp;\\coloneqq(E_3)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times E_3,\\qquad E_5\\coloneqq(E_2)^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_0(w)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\operatorname{aind}(w_i))_{i&lt;|w|})\\quad(w\\in E_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_1(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\operatorname{Token}(t_i))_{i&lt;|t|})\\quad(t\\in E_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_2(P_j(\\vec w))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle j,\\operatorname{code}_0(w_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_0(w_{r_j-1})\\rangle\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec w\\in(E_0)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_3(P_j(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle j,\\operatorname{code}_1(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_1(t_{r_j-1})\\rangle\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_4(\\vec A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\operatorname{code}_3(A_i))_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}),\n\\operatorname{code}_3(B)\\rangle\\quad((\\vec A,B)\\in E_4),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_5(\\vec A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\operatorname{code}_2(A_i))_{i&lt;|\\vec A|})\n\\quad(\\vec A\\in E_5),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\kappa\\in\\{0,\\ldots,5\\}\\quad\\operatorname{code}_\\kappa:E_\\kappa\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}_\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{aind}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a_i,i):i&lt;\\ell\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Token}(a_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle\\quad(i&lt;\\ell),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Token}(v_i)\\coloneqq\\langle1,i\\rangle\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{At}^{0}_{\\mathcal E}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{P_j(\\vec w):j&lt;m\\land\\vec w\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{r_j}\\},\\\\\nE_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^*,\\quad E_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\quad\nE_2\\coloneqq\\mathrm{At}^{0}_{\\mathcal E},\\quad E_3\\coloneqq\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P},\\\\\nE_4&amp;\\coloneqq(E_3)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times E_3,\\qquad E_5\\coloneqq(E_2)^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_0(w)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\operatorname{aind}(w_i))_{i&lt;|w|})\\quad(w\\in E_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_1(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\operatorname{Token}(t_i))_{i&lt;|t|})\\quad(t\\in E_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_2(P_j(\\vec w))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle j,\\operatorname{code}_0(w_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_0(w_{r_j-1})\\rangle\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec w\\in(E_0)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_3(P_j(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle j,\\operatorname{code}_1(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_1(t_{r_j-1})\\rangle\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_4(\\vec A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\operatorname{code}_3(A_i))_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}),\n\\operatorname{code}_3(B)\\rangle\\quad((\\vec A,B)\\in E_4),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_5(\\vec A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\operatorname{code}_2(A_i))_{i&lt;|\\vec A|})\n\\quad(\\vec A\\in E_5),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\kappa\\in\\{0,\\ldots,5\\}\\quad\\operatorname{code}_\\kappa:E_\\kappa\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}_\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Var}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists j&lt;|t|\\ t_j=v_i\\}\\quad(t\\in E_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(P_j(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;r_j}\\operatorname{Var}(t_i)\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\vec A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}\\operatorname{Var}(A_i)\n\\quad((\\vec A,B)\\in E_4),\\\\\na_i[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(0,a_i)\\}\\quad(i&lt;\\ell),\\qquad v_i[\\theta]\\coloneqq\\theta(i)\n\\quad(i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;0}w_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;n+1}w_i\\coloneqq(\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;n}w_i){}^\\frown w_n,\\\\\nt[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;|t|}t_i[\\theta]\n\\quad(t\\in E_1\\land\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\nP_j(\\vec t)[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq P_j(t_0[\\theta],\\ldots,t_{r_j-1}[\\theta])\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}\\land\n\\operatorname{Var}(P_j(\\vec t))\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\vec A[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq(A_i[\\theta])_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}\n\\quad(\\vec A\\in(E_3)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}\\operatorname{Var}(A_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\ni_R&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(j,i)\\in\\mathbb N^2:i\\in\\operatorname{Var}(R)\n\\land j=|\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\cap\\{h\\in\\mathbb N:h&lt;i\\}|\\},\\\\\ni_R&amp;:\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;|\\operatorname{Var}(R)|\\}\\to\\operatorname{Var}(R),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TabCode}_R(\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\langle i_R(j),\\operatorname{code}_0(\\theta(i_R(j)))\\rangle)_{j&lt;|\\operatorname{Var}(R)|}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Var}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists j&lt;|t|\\ t_j=v_i\\}\\quad(t\\in E_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(P_j(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;r_j}\\operatorname{Var}(t_i)\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\vec A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}\\operatorname{Var}(A_i)\n\\quad((\\vec A,B)\\in E_4),\\\\\na_i[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(0,a_i)\\}\\quad(i&lt;\\ell),\\qquad v_i[\\theta]\\coloneqq\\theta(i)\n\\quad(i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;0}w_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;n+1}w_i\\coloneqq(\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;n}w_i){}^\\frown w_n,\\\\\nt[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\frown}_{i&lt;|t|}t_i[\\theta]\n\\quad(t\\in E_1\\land\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\nP_j(\\vec t)[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq P_j(t_0[\\theta],\\ldots,t_{r_j-1}[\\theta])\n\\quad(j&lt;m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}\\land\n\\operatorname{Var}(P_j(\\vec t))\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\vec A[\\theta]&amp;\\coloneqq(A_i[\\theta])_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}\n\\quad(\\vec A\\in(E_3)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec A|}\\operatorname{Var}(A_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\ni_R&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(j,i)\\in\\mathbb N^2:i\\in\\operatorname{Var}(R)\n\\land j=|\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\cap\\{h\\in\\mathbb N:h&lt;i\\}|\\},\\\\\ni_R&amp;:\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;|\\operatorname{Var}(R)|\\}\\to\\operatorname{Var}(R),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TabCode}_R(\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\langle i_R(j),\\operatorname{code}_0(\\theta(i_R(j)))\\rangle)_{j&lt;|\\operatorname{Var}(R)|}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;r,t,s,b\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\exists\\theta\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{\\operatorname{Var}(R)}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;r=\\operatorname{code}_4(R)\\land t=\\operatorname{TabCode}_R(\\theta)\n\\land s=\\operatorname{code}_5(\\vec A[\\theta])\\land b=\\operatorname{code}_2(B[\\theta])\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}(s,b)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists r,t\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)\n\\land0&lt;|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|V|=\\aleph_0\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j&lt;m\\}\n\\land(\\forall j&lt;m\\ r_j\\in\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\{P_j:j&lt;m\\}\\cap(\\Sigma\\cup V)=\\varnothing\n\\land(\\forall i,j&lt;m\\ (P_i=P_j\\Longrightarrow i=j))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal R\\subseteq(E_3)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times E_3\\land|\\mathcal R|&lt;\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_4\n\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;r,t,s,b\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\exists\\theta\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{\\operatorname{Var}(R)}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;r=\\operatorname{code}_4(R)\\land t=\\operatorname{TabCode}_R(\\theta)\n\\land s=\\operatorname{code}_5(\\vec A[\\theta])\\land b=\\operatorname{code}_2(B[\\theta])\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}(s,b)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists r,t\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)\n\\land0&lt;|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|V|=\\aleph_0\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j&lt;m\\}\n\\land(\\forall j&lt;m\\ r_j\\in\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\{P_j:j&lt;m\\}\\cap(\\Sigma\\cup V)=\\varnothing\n\\land(\\forall i,j&lt;m\\ (P_i=P_j\\Longrightarrow i=j))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal R\\subseteq(E_3)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times E_3\\land|\\mathcal R|&lt;\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_4\n\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>规则实例化可解码给定表并逐项检查。判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}(s,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}(s,b)\\)</span> 时，先排除非法原子列和结论码。设全部输入字串长度之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。对每条有限规则，其中每个词变量都出现在某个模式位置；成功替换给该变量的字串必为某个输入字串的一段，因而长度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。枚举每个变量的所有长度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的字串（包括空字串）即可穷尽所有可能成功替换；有限枚举完毕即返回否。故两个关系均递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}\\)</span> 的元数。递归性不是由无界存在量词直接推得；证明中给出有界字串枚举的判定方法。此处为词替换系统，不替换成一阶项代换系统。</p>\n<p>具体词与词模式的编码角色现在分开写明；这只消除原先 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}\">\\(\\operatorname{code}\\)</span> 的角色歧义，不改变系统中的字串、规则或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b)\\)</span> 的四个数值参数。排序后的替换表由有限变量索引集的秩函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_R\">\\(i_R\\)</span> 唯一确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-elementary-system-definition","status":"resolved","id":"eb8e9519813ba70b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-elementary-system-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-elementary-system-definition","status":"resolved","id":"eb8e9519813ba70b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)$ 取 [[90-df-elementary-system-definition]]，其中 $\\Sigma=\\{a_i:i<\\ell\\}$、$V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$ 分别无重复，$\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j<m\\}$；$\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}$ 使用同一词模式语法。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 取 [[90-df-sequence-encoding]]，数值编码中的 $\\langle\\cdots\\rangle$ 也采用该编码；显式编码函数的实参、模式串和原子列使用集合论有限列。下面 $\\frown$ 是原始字串拼接。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R$；$\\theta:\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是具体词替换。$\\operatorname{Var}$、有序变量索引表、替换和替换表码均在下式定义。$\\mathrm{RecPred}_k$ 取 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a_i:i<\\ell\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j<m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdots\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\{0,\\ldots,5\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta:\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecPred}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RuleInst}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\epsilon&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{aind}&\\coloneqq\\{(a_i,i):i<\\ell\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Token}(a_i)&\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle\\quad(i<\\ell),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Token}(v_i)\\coloneqq\\langle1,i\\rangle\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{At}^{0}_{\\mathcal E}&\\coloneqq\n\\{P_j(\\vec w):j<m\\land\\vec w\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{r_j}\\},\\\\\nE_0&\\coloneqq\\Sigma^*,\\quad E_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\Sigma,V},\\quad\nE_2\\coloneqq\\mathrm{At}^{0}_{\\mathcal E},\\quad E_3\\coloneqq\\mathrm{At}_{\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P},\\\\\nE_4&\\coloneqq(E_3)^{<\\omega}\\times E_3,\\qquad E_5\\coloneqq(E_2)^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_0(w)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\operatorname{aind}(w_i))_{i<|w|})\\quad(w\\in E_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_1(t)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\operatorname{Token}(t_i))_{i<|t|})\\quad(t\\in E_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_2(P_j(\\vec w))&\\coloneqq\n\\langle j,\\operatorname{code}_0(w_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_0(w_{r_j-1})\\rangle\n\\quad(j<m\\land\\vec w\\in(E_0)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_3(P_j(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\n\\langle j,\\operatorname{code}_1(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{code}_1(t_{r_j-1})\\rangle\n\\quad(j<m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_4(\\vec A,B)&\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\operatorname{code}_3(A_i))_{i<|\\vec A|}),\n\\operatorname{code}_3(B)\\rangle\\quad((\\vec A,B)\\in E_4),\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_5(\\vec A)&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\operatorname{code}_2(A_i))_{i<|\\vec A|})\n\\quad(\\vec A\\in E_5),\\\\\n&\\forall\\kappa\\in\\{0,\\ldots,5\\}\\quad\\operatorname{code}_\\kappa:E_\\kappa\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}_\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Var}(t)&\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists j<|t|\\ t_j=v_i\\}\\quad(t\\in E_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(P_j(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<r_j}\\operatorname{Var}(t_i)\n\\quad(j<m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\vec A,B)&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\cup\\bigcup_{i<|\\vec A|}\\operatorname{Var}(A_i)\n\\quad((\\vec A,B)\\in E_4),\\\\\na_i[\\theta]&\\coloneqq\\{(0,a_i)\\}\\quad(i<\\ell),\\qquad v_i[\\theta]\\coloneqq\\theta(i)\n\\quad(i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\mathop{\\frown}_{i<0}w_i&\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\mathop{\\frown}_{i<n+1}w_i\\coloneqq(\\mathop{\\frown}_{i<n}w_i){}^\\frown w_n,\\\\\nt[\\theta]&\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\frown}_{i<|t|}t_i[\\theta]\n\\quad(t\\in E_1\\land\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\nP_j(\\vec t)[\\theta]&\\coloneqq P_j(t_0[\\theta],\\ldots,t_{r_j-1}[\\theta])\n\\quad(j<m\\land\\vec t\\in(E_1)^{r_j}\\land\n\\operatorname{Var}(P_j(\\vec t))\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\n\\vec A[\\theta]&\\coloneqq(A_i[\\theta])_{i<|\\vec A|}\n\\quad(\\vec A\\in(E_3)^{<\\omega}\\land\n\\bigcup_{i<|\\vec A|}\\operatorname{Var}(A_i)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)),\\\\\ni_R&\\coloneqq\\{(j,i)\\in\\mathbb N^2:i\\in\\operatorname{Var}(R)\n\\land j=|\\operatorname{Var}(R)\\cap\\{h\\in\\mathbb N:h<i\\}|\\},\\\\\ni_R&:\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<|\\operatorname{Var}(R)|\\}\\to\\operatorname{Var}(R),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TabCode}_R(\\theta)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\n((\\langle i_R(j),\\operatorname{code}_0(\\theta(i_R(j)))\\rangle)_{j<|\\operatorname{Var}(R)|}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&r,t,s,b\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists R=(\\vec A,B)\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\exists\\theta\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{\\operatorname{Var}(R)}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&r=\\operatorname{code}_4(R)\\land t=\\operatorname{TabCode}_R(\\theta)\n\\land s=\\operatorname{code}_5(\\vec A[\\theta])\\land b=\\operatorname{code}_2(B[\\theta])\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}(s,b)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists r,t\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal E)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal E=(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal R)\n\\land0<|\\Sigma|<\\aleph_0\\land|V|=\\aleph_0\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\quad\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathcal P=\\{(P_j,r_j):j<m\\}\n\\land(\\forall j<m\\ r_j\\in\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\{P_j:j<m\\}\\cap(\\Sigma\\cup V)=\\varnothing\n\\land(\\forall i,j<m\\ (P_i=P_j\\Longrightarrow i=j))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathcal R\\subseteq(E_3)^{<\\omega}\\times E_3\\land|\\mathcal R|<\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_4\n\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}(s,b)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RuleInst}_{\\mathcal E}(r,t,s,b)","display":false},{"tex":"i_R","display":false}],"bytes":7791,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb8e9519813ba70b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal R$ 的规则实例生成系统的断言闭包；“何时属于初等系统”由 [[90-df-elementary-system]] 判定。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-elementary-system-definition]]、[[90-df-elementary-system]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-